PURPOSE
H70-H77 established:
- emergent role assignment;
- adaptive role ecology;
- reversible canalization;
- local repair plasticity.

But all prior role experiments still supplied:
THE USEFUL TRANSFORMATION REPERTOIRE.

H78 removes a major privilege.

Cells receive:
a generic set of local operators,
including:
productive transformations,
dead ends,
and
high-activity loops.

They are not told:
which operators form the useful pathway.

QUESTION
Can useful computational roles emerge from:
DOWNSTREAM FUNCTIONAL CONSEQUENCE
+
PRODUCT PROVENANCE

rather than:
stage labels
or
local activity?

BOUNDARY
This is synthetic.

It does not:
- invent new primitive operators;
- prove the final Yggdrasil causal-credit mechanism;
- freeze global-pool transport;
- solve arbitrary program synthesis;
- modify or execute STAB-18-R1.

