GENERAL PRINCIPLE
Yggdrasil should distrust:

ACTIVITY AS SUCCESS.

The organism may need to distinguish:

COMPUTATION HAPPENED

from

COMPUTATION CONTRIBUTED.

That distinction is likely central to:
target-free developmental intelligence.

IMPORTANT LIMITATION
H78 still provides:
a fixed primitive operator repertoire.

It discovers:
a useful composition.

It does not invent:
a genuinely new primitive operation.

The synthetic global intermediate pool also removes:
spatial transport difficulty.

DECISION
AR-H78 is POSITIVE WITH A LOCAL-ACTIVITY CREDIT FAILURE.

Supported synthetically:

- initially symmetric cells can discover a useful multi-stage operator pathway;
- operator semantic IDs are not required;
- useful operator roles dominate expression under provenance-based terminal credit;
- role proportions emerge without target quotas;
- local activity reinforcement strongly favors useless loops;
- global terminal reward is insufficiently specific;
- product ancestry sharply improves transformation credit assignment.

Not demonstrated:

- spatially local pathway discovery;
- very long delayed credit;
- dynamic operator graph;
- invention of novel primitive operators;
- real target-free terminal function;
- robustness to corrupted provenance.

NEXT HIGH-VALUE MOVE
AR-H79 — COMPOSITIONAL CHUNKING / DEVELOPMENT OF NEW MACRO-OPERATORS

H78 discovers:
which primitive operator sequence is useful.

A more radical question:

CAN A REPEATEDLY USEFUL SEQUENCE
BECOME A NEW COMPACT DEVELOPMENTAL OPERATOR?

Example:

R -> A -> B

repeatedly succeeds.

Instead of permanently routing every future item through:
two separate slow role transitions,

the system may compile / canalize that sequence into:
a local macro-transformation.

Potential advantages:

- fewer active cells;
- lower communication;
- shorter causal chain;
- lower permanent control overhead.

Potential failures:

- chunk becomes stale when environment changes;
- chunk hides internal causal provenance;
- over-chunking reduces combinatorial reuse;
- corrupted sequence becomes permanent.

Compare:

A.
primitive-only pathway;

B.
frequency-based sequence chunking;

C.
consequence-gated chunk nomination;

D.
reversible macro-operator with fallback to primitives;

E.
task shift invalidating the old chunk.

Desired:

USEFUL REPEATED COMPOSITION
->
TEMPORARY / SLOWLY PROMOTED MACRO-OPERATOR.

Novel context
->
fall back to primitives.

This would begin testing:
development of computational structure itself,
not only:
role assignment over fixed primitives.

Do not execute STAB-18-R1 during this lane.

